# Generated test output. `stub/generated_tests/` is a generated directory
# (CLAUDE.md: do not hand-edit), but the demo_/golden_ corpus below IS tracked
# on purpose -- it's the catch-the-AI-cheating fixture set the demo and the
# audit gate depend on. Ignore everything else the generator writes there so a
# local `cherenkov generate` run doesn't dirty the tree.
stub/generated_tests/*
!stub/generated_tests/demo_*.spec.ts
!stub/generated_tests/golden_*.spec.ts
!stub/generated_tests/password_too_short.spec.ts
!stub/generated_tests/_scores.json
